# Security Policy

## Supported versions

| Version | Supported |
|---|---|
| latest  | ✅ |
| older   | ❌ |

## Reporting a vulnerability

**Do not file public issues for security reports.** Email ${author_email} with:

- A clear description of the vulnerability.
- Reproduction steps and a proof of concept where possible.
- Your assessment of impact.

We aim to acknowledge reports within 72 hours and to publish a fix within 30 days for high-severity issues.
